# Base URL of the deployed LevelUp backend API (Azure App Service), no
# trailing slash. Not a secret — the backend is a public read-only API with
# open CORS (see backend/README.md and docs/CHANGELOG.md).
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and adjust as needed:
#   - Local development against the backend running locally (`cd backend && npm run dev`):
#       VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
#   - Local development against the deployed dev backend:
#       VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://levelup-api-dev-dfgugzd7a0fvf47.swedencentral-01.azurewebsites.net
#   - Production (Azure Static Web Apps) build: set this as an environment
#     variable in the Static Web App / build pipeline configuration.
#
# If unset, the app falls back to http://localhost:4000 (see src/api/client.ts).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://levelup-api-dev-dfgugzd7a0fvf47.swedencentral-01.azurewebsites.net
